ID: B2-Ch01a-Innocent
TEXT:

set(v_ac_b2_ch1_breed,1) if (v_b2_ch1_spin == 0)
achievement("Half-breed",v_ac_b2_ch1_breed)
#if(v_b2_ch1_spin == 0 && v_ch11_kill_noble == 1 && v_ch11_saved_slave != 3) {
"We didn't kill him! We're innocent!"

"Indeed?" Golmyck strokes his chin, eyebrows raised. "That is peculiar. Official dispatches name you specifically as the one who ran the Earl of Ollendor through. You ought to know by now how difficult it is to conceal secrets in Thilias. Why offer such a transparent falsehood?"

"Your Majesty," Daren cuts in, stepping between me and the dais with a deep bow. "Allow me to explain what transpired."

